DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-23T09:06:07&endDate=2026-09-23T12:56:30">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWindrush Line: No service between New Cross Gate and Crystal Palace/West Croydon\, and SEVERE DELAYS between New Cross Gate and Highbury & Islington while we fix a signal failure at Norwood Junction. London Buses are accepting valid tickets via any reasonable route. GOOD SERVICE on the rest of the line. 
